# Addon controllers shipped by scripts/install-operators.sh
# Default namespace: kubeops-addon-controller (override with optional 6th column).
#
# Columns (whitespace-separated):
#   addon_id   go_cmd_pkg   image_name    deploy_name              component        [namespace]
#
# Optional 6th column overrides the shared kubeops-addon-controller namespace.
#
# To add a future controller:
#   1. Add ./cmd/<go_cmd_pkg>
#   2. Add Deployment+SA+CRB under config/manager/addons/ and config/rbac/addons/
#   3. Append a row here
#   4. Add Operator sample row (component column) in config/samples/operators.yaml
#
nfs              nfs              kubeops-nfs              kubeops-nfs-controller              nfs              kubeops-addon-controller
virtualization   virtualization   kubeops-virtualization   kubeops-virtualization-controller   virtualization   kubeops-addon-controller
